<section class="sec" id="faq" style="background:#fff">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">The questions people actually <span class="serif">ask.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">If yours isn't here, a counsellor answers it on a 20-minute call.</p>
<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>Do I need to know coding for this course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, by design. The no-code track ships real automations on platforms like Make; the code track goes deeper with Python and APIs. You choose per module, and many students blend both.</div></details>
<details><summary>What is the difference between this and the Data Science course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Data Science trains model-building: statistics, ML, training your own models over six months. This course trains application-building on top of existing frontier models: RAG, agents and automation, in four. Different jobs, both real.</div></details>
<details><summary>Are GenAI jobs actually stable or just hype? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">The titles will evolve; the capability will not. Companies wiring AI into workflows need builders regardless of what the role is called. We anchor the course in business workflows precisely so your skills survive tool churn.</div></details>
<details><summary>What salary can I expect in AI application roles? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Builders typically start between Rs 4 and 7 lakh, with proven shippers reaching Rs 7 to 14 lakh fast. Independent automation work for SMEs adds a parallel income path many alumni take.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will the course content go stale as models change? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Fundamentals here age slowly: retrieval, evaluation, tool use, workflow design. We update model specifics every cohort, but you are learning the patterns, not memorising one vendor's buttons.</div></details>
<details><summary>Can I freelance with these skills from Kerala? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes, and alumni do: AI automation for clinics, agencies, traders and Gulf SMEs is a genuine service business. A module covers scoping, pricing and demoing to non-technical buyers.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support and real introductions across 400+ partners, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
<aside class="faq-aside reveal">
<div class="aside-card">
<span class="av-lg photo">[ Anjali · photo ]</span>
<span class="k">Most chosen first step</span>
